# Internal services — reachable only with the "local" environment.
# In Kubernetes they are not exposed through the gateway (by design).

### Stock levels
GET {{inventory}}/api/inventory

### Single SKU
GET {{inventory}}/api/inventory/DEN-BUR-002

### Reserve (idempotent on orderRef — send twice and compare "replayed")
POST {{inventory}}/api/inventory/reservations
Content-Type: application/json

{ "orderRef": "manual-test-1", "items": [ { "sku": "DEN-GLV-001", "quantity": 2 } ] }

### Release
DELETE {{inventory}}/api/inventory/reservations/manual-test-1

### Quote — v1 (list price)
POST {{pricing}}/api/pricing/quotes
Content-Type: application/json

{ "items": [ { "sku": "DEN-GLV-001", "quantity": 30 } ] }

### Quote — v2 (volume discount) — run a second pricing instance on 8093 with PRICING_ENGINE_VERSION=v2
POST {{pricingV2}}/api/pricing/quotes
Content-Type: application/json

{ "items": [ { "sku": "DEN-GLV-001", "quantity": 30 } ] }
